WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.510
Picture the scene.

2
00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.740
A garden.

3
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.910
A tree.

4
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.160
A serpent.

5
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.540
And an apple.

6
00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:09.340
Except Genesis never says apple.

7
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.050
It only says fruit.

8
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.440
The apple comes from later art.

9
00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.800
Then come shame, hiding and blame.

10
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.420
And the garden is closed behind them.

11
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:24.220
So why do many Christians say that one
bite of fruit affects every human being

12
00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.320
since?

13
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.740
In this mission, you'll
read Genesis 3 closely:

14
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.290
what tempted, and what changed.

15
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.820
Then you'll compare what Catholic,
Protestant and Orthodox Christians mean by

16
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.390
original sin.

17
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: find out why many Christians
say the Fall touches every human life.
